Review the diff for Story 2.2 "Bewertung abgeben" (POST /api/products/{id}/ratings endpoint + frontend rating form). Diff content read from /tmp/review_diff.txt. This is a .NET/Angular e-commerce project. The endpoint creates or replaces a product rating (1-5 stars + author name), same author replaces previous rating via delete+insert in a transaction with one retry on unique-index conflict. Frontend adds a rating form to the product detail page that submits and refreshes the view.

